{"id":"R0091","e":{"E2":["T","PDF",3,"3. Model description and problem formulation","the task owners and energy sources","Models M rotary-wing UAVs (M={1,2,...,M}) as task owners and energy sources; Section 5 (p. 8 Table 2, p. 9 Fig. 5) evaluates M in [3, 6] UAVs."],"E4":["F","PDF",8,"5.1. Simulation settings","input data size is set to 500 kb","Evaluates MADRL/MASAC joint task-and-energy offloading on generic bit-wise tasks (p. 3 fn. 2; p. 8 Section 5/5.1, 500 kb, 1000 cycles/bit) rather than a proposed neural inference method under P03."]}}
{"id":"R0099","e":{"E2":["T","PDF",8,"IV.B. Multithreaded Processing Performance","independent UAV feed. As illustrated in Fig. 2","Evaluates single- and three-stream configurations where each stream corresponds to an independent UAV feed (pp. 8-9, Figs. 2-6, Table I; p. 10 Figs. 8-9 UAV1/UAV2)."],"E7":["U","https://journal.umy.ac.id/index.php/jrc/PE",0,"Peer Review Policy","INACCESSIBLE","Both https://journal.umy.ac.id/index.php/jrc/article/view/28366 and https://journal.umy.ac.id/index.php/jrc/PE were blocked/inaccessible via web browse; PDF (pp. 1-14) has substantive method (Section III) and results (Section IV) but contains no peer-review dates or policy text."]}}
{"id":"R0122","e":{"E4":["F","PDF",5,"4 Performance Evaluation and Discussion","multi-criteria optimization algorithms by showing the utility","Simulates PGO/SQP, BR, Greedy, and branch-and-bound on generic bit tasks (10-20 Mb, cycles/bit; p. 2 Section 2, p. 5 Section 4) for utility, trust, connectivity, and robustness; no neural inference method is proposed or evaluated."],"E5":["T","https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1145/3842721.3850224",0,"message.published-online.date-parts","Codex-supplied: published-online.date-parts [[2026,11,22]]","Crossref API URL was inaccessible via web browse; relying on Codex-supplied publisher deposit published-online 2026-11-22, within 2021-01-01 through 2026-11-26 (PDF p. 1 lists MobiHoc '26, Nov 23-26, 2026)."],"E7":["T","https://cybernet2026.github.io/cybernet2026/",0,"Submission Instructions / Session 4 Program","For single-blind review, submissions must include","Official CyberNet 2026 (ACM MobiHoc 2026 workshop) organizer page ties this exact paper and authors (Butt, Naeem, Ejaz) to Session 4 full paper presentation under single-blind review (max 6 pages), paired with substantive method and evaluation in PDF pp. 1-6."]}}
{"id":"R0128","e":{"E5":["U","https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/11626652",0,"Date of Publication","INACCESSIBLE","IEEE Xplore record https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/11626652 was inaccessible via web browse; Early Access PDF (p. 1) gives only DOI 10.1109/MIOT.2026.3711893, copyright 2026 IEEE, and Nov 27, 2026 download stamp, which cannot establish a verified publication date before 2026-11-26."]}}
{"id":"R0148","e":{"E4":["F","PDF",6,"4 Experimental results and analysis","compare the total system energy consumption under different schemes","Evaluates timeout rate and energy cost of a DNN-plus-DE offloading/deployment optimizer on indivisible generic tasks {C_i, D_i, T_i} (pp. 2, 4 Sections 2.1/2.5/3; pp. 6-7 Section 4); no neural inference method is evaluated."],"E5":["T","https://api.crossref.org/works/10.1145/3801359.3801406",0,"message.published-online.date-parts","Codex-supplied: published-online.date-parts [[2026,5,4]]","Crossref API URL was inaccessible via web browse; relying on Codex-supplied publisher deposit published-online 2026-05-04, within 2021-01-01 through 2026-11-26 (PDF p. 1 lists BDCTA 2026, Feb 06-08, 2026)."],"E7":["U","https://www.bdcta.org/2026",0,"BDCTA 2026 History / Editorial Policy","UNVERIFIED","Official site https://www.bdcta.org/2026 reports conference conclusion without peer-review policy or listing this paper; https://www.bdcta.org/EditorialPolicy and https://www.bdcta.org/Publication state peer-review policy for BDCTA 2027 (SPIE), not BDCTA 2026 (ACM); PDF pp. 1-8 has substantive method/results but no peer-review statement."]}}
